  data: {
    LLM: 'Player left of dealer leads first trick. Players must follow led color when possible; otherwise any card may be played. Highest card of led color wins the trick and leads next. There is no trump. After all cards are played, penalty points are counted from captured tricks and added to cumulative total.',
    Player: 'Player left of dealer leads first trick. Players must follow led color when possible; otherwise any card may be played. Highest card of led color wins the trick and leads next. There is no trump. After all cards are played, penalty points are counted from captured tricks and added to cumulative total.',
    objective: 'Finish six deals with the lowest cumulative penalty score.',
    gameplay: 'Player left of dealer leads first trick. Players must follow led color when possible; otherwise any card may be played. Highest card of led color wins the trick and leads next. There is no trump. After all cards are played, penalty points are counted from captured tricks and added to cumulative total.',
    keyRules: [
      'Each red card captured is 1 penalty, except red 5 is 5 and red 10 is 10.',
      'Yellow 10 (Golden Ten) subtracts 10 from your red penalties in that deal, minimum zero.',
      'Game length is six deals with dealer moving left each deal.',
      'Lowest cumulative penalty after final deal wins.',
    ],
